WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.221
Jack smiled and waved at the ogre's wife.

2
00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:14.686
"Go away, boy!" she said.

3
00:00:14.687 --> 00:00:20.417
As Jack walked closer, the woman blinked.

4
00:00:20.418 --> 00:00:25.836
"I remember you!" she cried.

5
00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:29.427
"I fed you breakfast one morning.

6
00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:34.341
That was the day my husband lost a bag of gold!"

7
00:00:34.342 --> 00:00:37.637
The ogre's wife glared at Jack.

8
00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:41.940
"The gold didn't just disappear," she said.

9
00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:45.398
"Somebody stole it!"

10
00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:48.670
"Hmm," Jack said slyly.

11
00:00:48.671 --> 00:00:55.706
"I might be able to tell you something about that.

12
00:00:55.707 --> 00:01:00.195
But . . . " He rubbed his belly.

13
00:01:00.196 --> 00:01:05.349
"I can't say another word until I eat something."

14
00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:09.191
"Hmpf!" The ogre's wife glared at Jack.

15
00:01:09.192 --> 00:01:19.729
But Jack could see that she was curious.

16
00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:27.525
With a sigh she invited Jack inside.

17
00:01:27.526 --> 00:01:30.605
The woman brought Jack some hot porridge.

18
00:01:30.606 --> 00:01:32.767
"Here," she snapped.

19
00:01:32.768 --> 00:01:34.732
"Eat your breakfast.

20
00:01:34.733 --> 00:01:42.798
Then tell me about the missing gold!"

21
00:01:42.799 --> 00:02:09.942
Jack picked up a spoon and tasted some porridge.

22
00:02:09.943 --> 00:02:19.806
Very, very slowly he sipped some tea.

23
00:02:19.807 --> 00:02:25.069
Then he patted his mouth with a napkin.

24
00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:31.104
"So . . . what's new?" Jack asked the ogre's wife.

25
00:02:31.105 --> 00:02:33.561
"Has the ogre caught any—"

26
00:02:33.562 --> 00:02:36.340
Thump! Thump! Thump!

27
00:02:36.341 --> 00:02:38.610
The house shook like thunder.

28
00:02:38.611 --> 00:02:40.999
"Perfect!" Jack thought.

29
00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.768
He looked down to hide his smile.

30
00:02:43.769 --> 00:02:49.750
The ogre was coming!

